{"id": "ST_WarTable|W2_Description", "source_en": "The Industrial Heart of Grimhaven was central to Gildenarch's revival and its demise. Weaponized divisions became the driving force behind the spear hurled towards the heavens.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "كان القلب الصناعي لقريمهاڤن محوراً أساسياً في نهضة قيلدنارك وسقوطها. أصبحت الأقسام المسلحة القوة الدافعة وراء الرمح الموجه نحو السماوات.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W1_D1_Boss_Title", "source_en": "The Warden", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "الحارس", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W1_DR1_Description", "source_en": "The catacombs of the Southern Ward run deep, holding secrets obscured by horrors and ancient traps.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "تمتد سراديب الحي الجنوبي في أعماق سحيقة، وتخفي أسراراً طمرتها الأهوال والفخاخ القديمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W2_D3_Description", "source_en": "The decrepit former home of the City Garrison, the Shoreditch Wall Tower now houses a rising battalion of demons and its resurrected General.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "في منزل حامية المدينة المتهالك سابقاً، تضم برج جدار شورديتش الآن كتيبة متنامية من الشياطين وجنرالهم الذي عاد للحياة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W3_D3_Description", "source_en": "The former home of Solomon Moore holds the secrets to his magic and whereabouts.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "يضم منزل سولومون مور القديم أسرار سحره ومكانه الحالي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W3_D1_Description", "source_en": "The site of investigation and experimentation with hellgrowth, Elk Grove Academy is now overrun with abominations and cultists alike.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "موقع البحث والتجارب على نمو الجحيم، أكاديمية إلك قروڤ، غارقة الآن بالمسوخ والعباد على حد سواء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|W2_D1_Boss_Title", "source_en": "Tyrigon, Dragon Menace", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "تيريقون، تهديد التنين", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|Enemies_Ward_W1_D1", "source_en": "Undead, Brutes, Captains, and Abominations detected.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "تم رصد موتى أحياء، ووحوش ضخمة، وقادة، ومسوخ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|FinalBossLockedDescription", "source_en": "Unlock the Final Boss by defeating the first two World Bosses and collecting the Abraxas Stones.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "افتح زعيم المرحلة النهائي عبر هزيمة أول زعيمين للعالم وجمع أحجار أبراكساس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
{"id": "ST_WarTable|WorldBossLockedDescription", "source_en": "Unlock this World Boss by completing all main missions in the same Ward.", "category": "quest", "speaker": null, "ar": "افتح زعيم العالم هذا عبر إكمال جميع المهمات الرئيسية في نفس الحي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 12}}
